/T (The four-machine readings and seven-row production example are transcribed directly from the assignment. Where the assignment requires larger datasets, they are generated reproducibly using fixed NumPy seeds: Q1 = 20260501, Q2 = 20260502, Q3 = 20260503, and Q4 machine metadata = 20260504. The large production input contains 1,000 distinct records plus 12 duplicate rows deliberately included to test cleaning, leaving precisely 1,000 cleaned records. Missing values and unmatched machine metadata are intentionally included to test quality controls. Generated data are experimental records rather than observations claimed to have come from a real factory. )
