/T (For Output_Units, dropping a row could distort a small line-level sample, so line-median imputation is used while also recording which values were filled. For Defects, same-line median filling is a simple continuity policy, but it risks attenuating high-defect episodes. The report therefore preserves counts of replacements and recommends flagging imputed rows for sensitivity analysis when operational data become available. )
